@startuml keymap-rebind-state
title Keymap window: rebind one command's shortcut

[*] --> Idle

Idle --> Listening : click Edit on a row\n(start_keymap_capture)

state Listening {
}

Listening --> Pending : key event captured\n(poll_keymap_capture builds\nKeyChord + conflicts())

state Pending {
  [*] --> ConflictFree : conflicts() empty
  [*] --> ConflictWarned : conflicts() non-empty\n(warning shown, still confirmable)
}

Pending --> Idle : Confirm\n(confirm_keymap_capture:\nset_override, row updates)
Pending --> Idle : Cancel\n(cancel_keymap_capture:\nnothing committed)

Idle --> Idle : Reset\n(reset_keymap_binding,\nfalls back to scheme default)

@enduml
